    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"page\" id=\"page-graft-skeleton\">\n  <div class=\"page-header\">\n    <div class=\"page-eyebrow\">Undead / Plant · Ranged Scout · CR 1 · XP 200</div>\n    <div class=\"page-title\">Grafted Skeleton</div>\n    <div class=\"page-subtitle\">A skeleton augmented with orthogenic plant grafts — used for scouting, ranged harassment, and ambush</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"lore-box\"><p>\"The diviner reads the hidden pattern. I simply gave the skeleton new eyes.\" — D.C., margin note on Divination</p></div>\n  <div class=\"stat-block\">\n    <div class=\"sb-head\">\n      <div class=\"sb-name\">Grafted Skeleton</div>\n      <div class=\"sb-type\">Medium undead (plant), lawful evil</div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">CR 1</span><span class=\"tag\">200 XP</span><span class=\"tag tag-green\">Standard Minion</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sb-body\">\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Armor Class</div><div class=\"attr-val\">13 (bark-graft plating)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Hit Points</div><div class=\"attr-val\">26 (4d8 + 8)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Speed</div><div class=\"attr-val\">30 ft, climb 20 ft</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"core-stats\">\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">STR</div><div class=\"cs-val\">10</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+0)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">DEX</div><div class=\"cs-val\">16</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+3)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CON</div><div class=\"cs-val\">14</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(+2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">INT</div><div class=\"cs-val\">6</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–2)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">WIS</div><div class=\"cs-val\">8</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–1)</div></div>\n        <div class=\"core-stat\"><div class=\"cs-label\">CHA</div><div class=\"cs-val\">5</div><div class=\"cs-mod\">(–3)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"attr-row\">\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Vulnerabilities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">bludgeoning, fire</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Damage Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">poison</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Condition Immunities</div><div class=\"attr-val\">exhaustion, poisoned</div></div>\n        <div class=\"attr\"><div class=\"attr-label\">Senses</div><div class=\"attr-val\">darkvision 60 ft, tremorsense 15 ft, passive Perception 9</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Special Traits</div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">False Appearance</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">While motionless in foliage or among trees, the grafted skeleton is indistinguishable from a dead tree or vine-covered ruin. Perception DC 17 to detect.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"trait\"><div class=\"trait-name\">Grafted Sight</div><p class=\"trait-desc\">The skeleton's eye sockets contain living orthogenic plant-eyes. It has advantage on Perception checks that rely on sight and cannot be surprised while it has at least 1 hit point. It relays visual information to Diane Clearwater if she is within 1 mile, as long as the skeleton is intact.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"rule\"></div>\n      <div class=\"section-head\">Actions</div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Thorn Volley</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Ranged Weapon Attack:</em> +5 to hit, range 60/120 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 8 (2d4 + 3) piercing damage plus 3 (1d6) poison damage (botanical toxin, not venom — poison immunity does not apply unless immunity is to plant-based toxins specifically).</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Bone Claw</div><p class=\"action-desc\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +5 to hit, reach 5 ft, one target. <em>Hit:</em> 6 (1d6 + 3) slashing damage.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"action\"><div class=\"action-name\">Root Pin <em>(1/day)</em></div><p class=\"action-desc\">The skeleton drives a graft-root into the ground at a point within 10 ft. One creature within 5 ft of that point must succeed on a DC 13 Strength save or be restrained until freed (DC 13 Strength check). The pin is a physical object (AC 8, 5 HP) and can be destroyed.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "public": ""
      },
